## The Publish Tab

Once your video is rendered in the **Edit** tab, move to the **Publish** tab.

## Metadata

Fill in the details for your video:
- **Title**: A catchy title for YouTube.
- **Description**: Add keywords and summaries.
- **Tags**: Comma-separated tags to help discovery.
- **Visibility**: Public, Private, or Unlisted.

## Publishing

1. Select the platform (e.g., YouTube).
2. Click **Publish**.
3. The video will be uploaded directly to your channel. You can view the link immediately after success.

## Shorts

StoryBook can also auto-format your content for YouTube Shorts / TikTok.
(Feature in development - see Roadmap)